#: 1e24b987905a4df7bc94dbdbfdf18430 of
#: pybroker.scope.IndicatorScope.fetch_full:1
msgid "Fetches the full indicator array without truncation."
msgstr "获取未经截断的完整指标数组。"

#: af73825f13c74339bd18dc291d11a200 of
#: pybroker.scope.IndicatorScope.fetch_history:1
msgid "Aligns full-history indicator values to ``dates``."
msgstr "将完整历史指标值对齐到 ``dates``。"

#: 42fdb5a6da014653bee509313d7249a8 of
#: pybroker.scope.IndicatorScope.fetch_history:3
msgid ""
":meth:`fetch` masks base timeframe indicators to ``filter_dates``, so it "
"cannot serve data from before the current window. Lag features need "
"history that reaches back into the train window, which this reads from "
"the unfiltered series."
msgstr ""
":meth:`fetch` 会将基础时间框架的指标遮罩到 "
"``filter_dates``，因此无法提供当前窗口之前的数据。滞后特征需要能够回溯到训练窗口的历史数据，本方法正是从未过滤的序列中读取这些数据。"

#: f787366cf0fc4ee0beefa5e6aa6a2e24 of
#: pybroker.scope.IndicatorScope.fetch_history:8
msgid ""
":class:`numpy.ndarray` of values aligned to ``dates``, or ``None`` when "
"the indicator is not registered for ``symbol``."
msgstr "对齐到 ``dates`` 的值 :class:`numpy.ndarray`；当 ``symbol`` 未注册该指标时为 ``None``。"

#: c1affba6b285420895eea6f404db43d7 of
