msgstr "获取一个字典，其中包含每个品种的 K 线数据、指标数据和模型预测结果的 :class:`pandas.DataFrame`\\。"

#: 34d82dc7fa1845959d523c3e491ed83f of
#: pybroker.scope.merge_symbol_array_stores:1
msgid "Concatenates per-symbol column arrays from two stores."
msgstr "拼接两个存储中各品种的列数组。"

#: 97798a048d614b0485065a740415601f of pybroker.scope.register_columns:1
msgid "Registers ``names`` of user-defined data columns."
msgstr "注册用户自定义数据列的 ``names``。"

#: c52318c3383646f9bc70fc16bdd54a2e of pybroker.scope.run_with_scope:1
msgid "Installs ``scope`` as this process' scope, then runs ``fn``."
msgstr "将 ``scope`` 安装为本进程的作用域，然后运行 ``fn``。"

#: ef84e43f6e744c26b0b2ba384cc12c5a of pybroker.scope.run_with_scope:3
msgid ""
":class:`StaticScope` is a per-process singleton, so a worker process "
"starts with an empty one and would not see the caller's registered "
"indicators, model sources, params or custom columns. Wrap work dispatched"
" to ``pybroker.parallel.parallel()`` in this to ship the caller's scope "
"along with it. Running sequentially, ``scope`` is already the installed "
"instance and this is a no-op."
msgstr ""
":class:`StaticScope` "
"是每个进程的单例，因此工作进程启动时会得到一个空的单例，无法看到调用方已注册的指标、模型源、参数或自定义列。将分发给 "
"``pybroker.parallel.parallel()`` 的工作用本方法包裹起来，即可随之传递调用方的作用域。在顺序运行时， "
"``scope`` 已经是已安装的实例，此时本方法不产生任何效果。"

#: 8aac2eade17a435ca2d3a0fe047bd7c8 of
#: pybroker.scope.slice_symbol_array_store_by_dates:1
msgid "Filters a store to rows whose dates are in ``selected_dates``."
msgstr "将存储过滤为日期属于 ``selected_dates`` 的行。"

#: 39da5312285c41759b94b677d94e6773 of pybroker.scope.sym_data_from_store:1
msgid "Converts a :class:`SymbolArrayStore` to per-symbol column arrays."
msgstr "将 :class:`SymbolArrayStore` 转换为各品种的列数组。"

#: a68d1aa3cc3f44ffb9dd87cdcd0cb964 of
#: pybroker.scope.sym_exec_dates_from_store:1
msgid "Returns per-symbol test dates from a column store."
msgstr "从列存储中返回各品种的测试日期。"

#: 84e16f0d47634e7f806ae4ad89dca647 of
#: pybroker.scope.sym_exec_dates_from_store:3
msgid ""
"Symbols are walked in sorted order. :attr:`SymbolArrayStore.symbols` is a"
" ``frozenset[str]``, so iterating it directly would seed this mapping in "
"string-hash order, and that order decides which symbol is served first on"
" each bar when calendars are ragged -- making a capital-constrained "
"backtest depend on ``PYTHONHASHSEED``. Sorting also matches the "
"``sorted(test_syms)`` order the aligned-calendar path already uses."
msgstr ""
"品种会按排序后的顺序遍历。:attr:`SymbolArrayStore.symbols` 是一个 "
"``frozenset[str]``，若直接对其迭代，会按字符串哈希顺序生成该映射，而当各品种交易日历参差不齐时，这个顺序会决定每根 K "
"线上哪个品种被优先处理 —— 这会使资金受限的回测依赖于 ``PYTHONHASHSEED``。排序还能与日历对齐路径已经使用的 "
"``sorted(test_syms)`` 顺序保持一致。"

#: dce30b15c4194814adba51acad2fed6f of
